/usr/lib/uhd/examples/tx_waveforms --ant TX/RX --channel 0 --rate 1e6 --freq 5e9 --gain 50

On a cellsdr radio:

/usr/lib/uhd/examples/tx_waveforms --freq 2622e6 --rate 5e6 --gain 80

This also works, but need gnuradio installed.

TX: uhd_siggen_gui -f 2625e6 -s 10e6
RX: uhd_fft -f 2625e6 -s 10e6 -g 35

But see image from Alex about settings in the GUI.

